ke out your pencil.","v":"t"},{"text":"Line up at the door.","v":"t"},{"text":"Work in pairs.","v":"t"},{"text":"Write your name.","v":"t"},{"text":"Colour the picture.","v":"t"},{"text":"Tidy up, please.","v":"t"},{"text":"Come here, please.","v":"t"},{"text":"Put on your jacket.","v":"t"},{"text":"Wash your hands.","v":"t"},{"text":"Turn the page.","v":"t"},{"text":"Draw a picture.","v":"t"},{"text":"Eat your lunch.","v":"t"},{"text":"Go outside.","v":"t"},{"text":"Say it again.","v":"t"},{"text":"Good morning, class!","v":"t"},{"text":"Let's start.","v":"t"},{"text":"Look at me.","v":"t"},{"text":"Repeat after me.","v":"t"},{"text":"Be careful!","v":"t"},{"text":"Hurry up!","v":"t"},{"text":"Open the window.","v":"t"},{"text":"Close the door.","v":"t"},{"text":"Turn off the light.","v":"t"},{"text":"Put your things away.","v":"t"},{"text":"Pack your bag.","v":"t"},{"text":"Find page twelve.","v":"t"},{"text":"Read the text.","v":"t"},{"text":"Read out loud.","v":"t"},{"text":"Listen and repeat.","v":"t"},{"text":"Match the words.","v":"t"},{"text":"Circle the right answer.","v":"t"},{"text":"Tick the box.","v":"t"},{"text":"Cut it out.","v":"t"},{"text":"Glue it in your book.","v":"t"},{"text":"Fill in the missing words.","v":"t"},{"text":"Work alone.","v":"t"},{"text":"Work in groups.","v":"t"},{"text":"Talk to your partner.","v":"t"},{"text":"Don't talk.","v":"t"},{"text":"Don't run!","v":"t"},{"text":"Make a circle.","v":"t"},{"text":"Sit on the floor.","v":"t"},{"text":"Come to the front.","v":"t"},{"text":"Go back to your seat.","v":"t"},{"text":"Are you ready?","v":"t"},{"text":"Who knows the answer?","v":"t"},{"text":"Any questions?","v":"t"},{"text":"Well done!","v":"t"},{"text":"Try again.","v":"t"},{"text":"It's break time.","v":"t"},{"text":"It's lunch time.","v":"t"},{"text":"Put on your shoes.","v":"t"},{"text":"Take off your shoes.","v":"t"},{"text":"Hang up your jacket.","v":"t"},{"text":"Drink some water.","v":"t"},{"text":"You can go to the toilet.","v":"t"},{"text":"Do your homework.","v":"t"},{"text":"Write the date.","v":"t"},{"text":"Count to ten.","v":"t"},{"text":"Spell your name.","v":"t"},{"text":"Show me.","v":"t"},{"text":"Point to the picture.","v":"t"},{"text":"Stop!","v":"t"},{"text":"See you tomorrow!","v":"t"},{"text":"Goodbye, class!","v":"t"},{"text":"Hello! My name is Emma. I am eight years old. I have a cat. My cat is black.","v":"t"},{"text":"How old is Emma?","v":"t"},{"text":"What colour is Emma's cat?","v":"t"},{"text":"Hi! I'm Leo. I like apples and bananas. I don't like fish.","v":"t"},{"text":"What does Leo like?","v":"t"},{"text":"apples and bananas","v":"t"},{"text":"What does Leo not like?","v":"t"},{"text":"apples","v":"t"},{"text":"bananas","v":"t"},{"text":"It is cold and snowy today. Sam puts on his hat and his gloves. Then he goes out to play in the snow.","v":"t"},{"text":"What is the weather like?","v":"t"},{"text":"What does Sam put on?","v":"t"},{"text":"hat and gloves","v":"t"},{"text":"a dress","v":"t"},{"text":"Good morning, class! Please sit down and open your books at page ten.","v":"t"},{"text":"What must you open?","v":"t"},{"text":"your book","v":"t"},{"text":"your bag","v":"t"},{"text":"the door","v":"t"},{"text":"What page?","v":"t"},{"text":"This is my family. I have a mum, a dad and a little brother. My brother is a baby. He is very funny!","v":"t"},{"text":"Who is the baby?","v":"t"},{"text":"my brother","v":"t"},{"text":"my mum","v":"t"},{"text":"my dad","v":"t"},{"text":"Is the baby funny or sad?","v":"t"},{"text":"funny","v":"t"},{"text":"Look at the animals! The dog is big. The mouse is small. The bird can fly.","v":"t"},{"text":"Which animal can fly?","v":"t"},{"text":"the dog","v":"t"},{"text":"the mouse","v":"t"},{"text":"the bird","v":"t"},{"text":"Which animal is small?","v":"t"},{"text":"the elephant","v":"t"},{"text":"Today is Mia's birthday. She is nine years old. She gets a big cake and a red ball.","v":"t"},{"text":"How old is Mia today?","v":"t"},{"text":"What colour is the ball?","v":"t"},{"text":"Tom is sad. He can't find his pencil. Look! The pencil is under the chair. Now Tom is happy.","v":"t"},{"text":"What can't Tom find?","v":"t"},{"text":"his pencil","v":"t"},{"text":"his book","v":"t"},{"text":"his bag","v":"t"},{"text":"Where is the pencil?","v":"t"},{"text":"under the chair","v":"t"},{"text":"in the bag","v":"t"},{"text":"in the book","v":"t"},{"text":"Hello! What's your name? My name is Nora. How are you, Nora? I'm fine, thank you!","v":"t"},{"text":"What is her name?","v":"t"},{"text":"Emma","v":"t"},{"text":"Nora","v":"t"},{"text":"Mia","v":"t"},{"text":"How is Nora?","v":"t"},{"text":"fine","v":"t"},{"text":"On Monday I go swimming. On Tuesday I play football. On Wednesday I read a book.","v":"t"},{"text":"What do I do on Tuesday?","v":"t"},{"text":"football","v":"t"},{"text":"When do I go swimming?","v":"t"},{"text":"My favourite animal is the elephant. It is big and grey. It has big ears and a long nose.","v":"t"},{"text":"What is my favourite animal?","v":"t"},{"text":"the lion","v":"t"},{"text":"the monkey","v":"t"},{"text":"What colour is it?","v":"t"},{"text":"It is lunch time. Ali has a sandwich, an apple and a glass of milk. Yum!","v":"t"},{"text":"What does Ali drink?","v":"t"},{"text":"What fruit does Ali have?","v":"t"},{"text":"a banana","v":"t"},{"text":"an apple","v":"t"},{"text":"strawberries","v":"t"},{"text":"This is my dog. His name is Rex. He is brown and he likes to run in the park.","v":"t"},{"text":"What is the dog's name?","v":"t"},{"text":"Max","v":"t"},{"text":"Rex","v":"t"},{"text":"Leo","v":"t"},{"text":"What colour is Rex?","v":"t"},{"text":"It is summer. It is hot and sunny. Lisa and her dad go to the beach. They swim in the sea.","v":"t"},{"text":"Who goes to the beach with Lisa?","v":"t"},{"text":"her dad","v":"t"},{"text":"her mum","v":"t"},{"text":"her grandma","v":"t"},{"text":"What do they do in the sea?","v":"t"},{"text":"swim","v":"t"},{"text":"play football","v":"t"},{"text":"read","v":"t"},{"text":"Mum and I go to the shop. We buy milk, bread and three apples.","v":"t"},{"text":"How many apples?","v":"t"},{"text":"What do they buy?","v":"t"},{"text":"milk and bread","v":"t"},{"text":"In my school bag I have two books, a red pencil case and my lunch box.","v":"t"},{"text":"How many books?","v":"t"},{"text":"What colour is the pencil case?","v":"t"},{"text":"We are at the zoo. I can see a lion, two giraffes and a monkey. The monkey is eating a banana.","v":"t"},{"text":"What is the monkey eating?","v":"t"},{"text":"a carrot","v":"t"},{"text":"How many giraffes?","v":"t"},{"text":"It is raining. Ben can't play outside. He plays with his toy cars in his room.","v":"t"},{"text":"What does Ben play with?","v":"t"},{"text":"toy cars","v":"t"},{"text":"a teddy bear","v":"t"},{"text":"a kite","v":"t"},{"text":"I get up at seven o'clock. I eat breakfast and brush my teeth. Then I go to school.","v":"t"},{"text":"When do I get up?","v":"t"},{"text":"seven o'clock","v":"t"},{"text":"eight o'clock","v":"t"},{"text":"six o'clock","v":"t"},{"text":"What do I brush?","v":"t"},{"text":"my teeth","v":"t"},{"text":"my shoes","v":"t"},{"text":"my dog","v":"t"},{"text":"Where is the cat? Is it on the bed? No! Is it under the chair? Yes! The cat is under the chair.","v":"t"},{"text":"Where is the cat?","v":"t"},{"text":"on the bed","v":"t"},{"text":"Is the cat on the bed?","v":"t"},{"text":"I don't know","v":"t"},{"text":"Dad is making pancakes. He needs eggs, milk and flour. Yummy! I love pancakes.","v":"t"},{"text":"What is Dad making?","v":"t"},{"text":"a cake","v":"t"},{"text":"What does he need?","v":"t"},{"text":"eggs and milk","v":"t"},{"text":"Oscar plays football on Saturday. His team is green. He scores a goal! Oscar is very happy.","v":"t"},{"text":"When does Oscar play football?","v":"t"},{"text":"What colour is his team?","v":"t"},{"text":"Draw a big house. Colour the door red. Colour the sun yellow. Now draw a tree next to the house.","v":"t"},{"text":"What colour is the door?","v":"t"},{"text":"What do you draw next to the house?","v":"t"},{"text":"a tree","v":"t"},{"text":"a car","v":"t"},{"text":"a dog","v":"t"},{"text":"My birthday is in May. I want a bike for my birthday. A blue bike!","v":"t"},{"text":"When is my birthday?","v":"t"},{"text":"What do I want?","v":"t"},{"text":"a bike","v":"t"},{"text":"a game","v":"t"},{"text":"A little green frog sits on a leaf. It is hungry. A fly comes by. Yum! The frog eats the fly.","v":"t"},{"text":"What colour is the frog?","v":"t"},{"text":"What does the frog eat?","v":"t"},{"text":"a fly","v":"t"},{"text":"a fish","v":"t"},{"text":"In winter it is cold. We go skiing in the mountains. Then we drink hot chocolate.","v":"t"},{"text":"What do we do in the mountains?","v":"t"},{"text":"go skiing","v":"t"},{"text":"ride a bike","v":"t"},{"text":"What do we drink?","v":"t"},{"text":"hot chocolate","v":"t"},{"text":"On Sunday we visit Grandma. She has a big garden with red flowers. She makes a cake for us.","v":"t"},{"text":"Who do we visit?","v":"t"},{"text":"the teacher","v":"t"},{"text":"What colour are the flowers?","v":"t"},{"text":"I go to school by bus. The bus is yellow. My friend Ella sits next to me.","v":"t"},{"text":"How do I go to school?","v":"t"},{"text":"by bus","v":"t"},{"text":"by car","v":"t"},{"text":"by bike","v":"t"},{"text":"Who sits next to me?","v":"t"},{"text":"Ella","v":"t"},{"text":"Teddy is a small bear. He has a red hat and blue shoes. He likes honey.","v":"t"},{"text":"What does Teddy like?","v":"t"},{"text":"honey","v":"t"},{"text":"What colour is his hat?","v":"t"},{"text":"Can I have a pencil, please? Yes, here you are. Thank you!","v":"t"},{"text":"What does the child want?","v":"t"},{"text":"a pencil","v":"t"},{"text":"a book","v":"t"},{"text":"What does the child say at the end?","v":"t"},{"text":"Anna is not at school today. She is sick. She stays in bed and sleeps.","v":"t"},{"text":"Where is Anna?","